---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PostRow from '../../components/PostRow.astro';
import ContentFilter from '../../components/ContentFilter.astro';
import {postTopics} from '../../lib/topics';
const all=await getCollection('posts',p=>!p.data.draft);
const posts=all.filter(p=>!p.data.archive).sort((a,b)=>+(b.data.updated??b.data.date)-+(a.data.updated??a.data.date)||+b.data.date-+a.data.date);
const tags=[...new Set(posts.flatMap(postTopics))].sort();
---
<SiteLayout title="기술 글"><section class="container page-intro"><h1>기술 글</h1><p>개발 중 만난 문제와 재현한 실험을 정리합니다. 최근 작성하거나 수정한 글부터 표시합니다.</p><p class="archive-note"><a href="/writing/archive/">통합한 글·학습 메모 {all.filter(p=>p.data.archive).length}편은 보관함에 있습니다 →</a></p></section><section class="container listing-section"><ContentFilter tags={tags}/><div class="post-list">{posts.map(post=><div data-filter-item data-tags={JSON.stringify(postTopics(post))} data-search={`${post.data.title} ${post.data.description} ${postTopics(post).join(' ')}`}><PostRow post={post}/></div>)}</div><p class="empty-state" data-filter-empty hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다. 다른 검색어를 입력해 보세요.</p></section></SiteLayout>
